The failing tests show that `error(...)` alone did not make the saves fail. It only records the error in `fflib_SObjectDomain.Errors`. The fix keeps that call for unit-test visibility and also attaches the message to the `Amount` field of the offending record with `addError`, so the platform rejects only that record.

