The deploy error doesn't name a cause, so I reviewed each file against the package's metadata definitions. The likely culprit is the `Before_Insert__c` value in the three `Trigger_Action` records. That field is a `MetadataRelationship` to `sObject_Trigger_Setting__mdt`, so its value must be a qualified reference, `sObject_Trigger_Setting__mdt.Contact`, not the bare string `Contact`. I've corrected that in all three records. The Apex classes are unchanged.

